      "description": "Twelve free, open-source Claude Code skills that write design tokens (Figma variables and text styles) into your open Figma file: color scales, Brand, Alias and Mapped tiers, Light and Dark, spacing, radius, border width, motion, a responsive type scale, a documentation page and code export.",
